The Qt PNG/JPEG handlers in third_party/qt-5.11.3 are unmodified Qt Base 5.11.3 source from the matching SDK. Their original copyright and license notices are retained, with GPLv2/GPLv3/LGPLv3 license texts. DshanControl distributes this component under GPL-3.0-only, consistent with the main application. SOURCE.json records exact source hashes. libpng and libjpeg remain system dependencies; their binaries are not vendored here.

This module uses private Qt headers and must be rebuilt against the exact target Qt module build. The qmake gate rejects other Qt versions. Install only in the application's bin/imageformats directory. The wrapper enables the omitted PNG handler only in this plugin translation unit; it does not patch QtGui or claim compatibility with an unverified system runtime.
